    "preamble": "Chidurala Nagaraju vs Sub Inspector Of Police on 21 September, 2020 Author: K. Lakshman Bench: K. Lakshman Honourable Sri Justice K. Lakshman Criminal Petition No.4070 Of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "The petitioners are Accused Nos.1 and 2 in the said case. The offences alleged against them are under Sections 420, 270, 273 and 188 of IPC. 2.",
